OL,5,
OL,6,CG2024FMr Bates vs The Post Office: The
OL,7,FImpact airs on ITV 1. A continuation of
OL,8,Fthe factual drama Mr Bates vs The Post
OL,9,FOffice (aired in January 2024),
OL,10,Frevealing the extraordinary effect the
OL,11,Ffour-part series had on the lives of
OL,12,Fthe sub-postmasters it featured, as
OL,13,Fwell as providing an insight into the
OL,14,Fongoing struggle for justice and
OL,15,Ffinancial redress.
